{"When shard splitting is used with ad-hoc filters, applyTemplateVariables is called twice on the same queries: first in runShardSplitQuery at the start, then again in runSplitQuery when the shard splitting logic delegates to it. Since the subRequest spreads the original request (preserving request.filters), ad-hoc filters get applied twice via addAdHocFilters, resulting in duplicate labels in the final query expression like {job=\"test\", namespace=\"default\", namespace=\"default\"}": 0.9440640807151794}